sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant System
    participant Database

    User ->> System: Open Analysis Section
    System ->> Database: Fetch User Food Logs
    Database -->> System: Retrieve Nutrient Data

    System ->> System: Calculate Daily Intake
    System ->> System: Compare with Recommended Values

    alt Deficiencies Found
        System ->> User: Show Missing Nutrients
        System ->> Database: Fetch Food Suggestions
        Database -->> System: Retrieve Nutrient-Rich Foods
        System ->> User: Recommend Foods to Improve Intake
    else No Deficiencies
        System ->> User: Show "All Nutrients Balanced"
    end
